@startuml Deployment with Contract Sequence Diagram
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam ParticipantPadding 20
skinparam BoxPadding 10

title Contract Status Checks

actor "Requester\n(Service Provider)" as Requester
participant "Requester DMS" as ReqDMS
participant "Contract Host\n(Solution Enabler)" as ContractHost
participant "Contract Actor" as ContractActor
database "Contract Database" as ContractDB
actor "Provider\n(Compute Provider)" as Provider
participant "Provider DMS" as ProvDMS
'participant "Payment Validator" as PaymentValidator
'participant "Blockchain RPC" as MockRPC

== State Transition Summary ==

note over ContractActor
    **Contract State Transitions:**
    DRAFT → ACCEPTED → SETTLED → TERMINATED
end note

== Contract Status Checks ==

group Invalid Contract Check: 'not all parties signed'
    Provider -> ProvDMS: **ContractValidationBehavior**\nValidate contract
    ProvDMS -> ContractHost: Request validation\n(contract DID)
    ContractHost -> ContractActor: Check contract status
    ContractActor -> ContractDB: Get contract
    ContractActor --> ContractHost: Not all parties signed
    ContractHost --> ProvDMS: Valid: **false**
    ProvDMS --> Provider: Contract not valid

    note over Requester, Provider
        Contract is invalid because Provider
        has not yet approved/signed it
    end note
end

group Contract Status Check: ACCEPTED
    Requester -> ReqDMS: **ContractStatusBehavior**\nCheck contract status
    ReqDMS -> ContractHost: Request status (contract DID)
    ContractHost -> ContractActor: Get current state
    ContractActor -> ContractDB: Fetch contract
    ContractActor --> ContractHost: Contract details
    ContractHost --> ReqDMS: State: **ACCEPTED**
    ReqDMS --> Requester: Contract is accepted
end

@enduml
